    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n79175" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">παρεγ-γράφω</span></b> 
		<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">[γρᾰ]</span>, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>write by the side, subjoin</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὸ αὑτοῦ ὄνομα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Pl.
					<u>Lg.</u>
					753c
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b> in bad sense,
				<i>mterpolate</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τι ἐν ψηφίσματι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Aeschin.
					3.74
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Plu.
				<u>CG</u>
				17
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Gal.
				15.9
			</span></i> (
				Pass.
			), <i><span class="en">
				17(1).606
			</span></i> ; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἔπος ἐν τῷ καταλόγῳ</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Str.
					9.1.10
				</span></i>
			 ; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">π. ἑαυτὸν ταῖς διαθήκαις</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Luc.
					<u>Ind.</u>
					19
				</span></i>
			 ; <i>enrol illegally</i> among the citizens, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">εἰς τοὺς φυλέτας</span> Id.<i>Bis
				Acc.</i><i><span class="en">
				27
			</span></i> ; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">παρεγγραφεὶς πολίτης</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Aeschin.
					2.76
				</span></i>
			.</div>
